<title>USA: Essef sets 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>Essef sets 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>CHARDON, Ohio 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Essef Corp said Thursday that it has set a two-for-one stock split.</p>
<p>The additional shares are to be distributed on September 9 to shareholders of record on August 22.</p>
<p>&quot;Our objectives in declaring the two-for-one split are to improve the stock's liquidity by increasing the number of shares outstanding and to lower the price, making it more attractive and accessible to a wider range of investors,&quot; President and Chief Executive Thomas Waldin said in a statement.</p>
<p>In early afternoon trading, Essef's shares were up 1-1/8 at 31-7/8.</p>
<p>Essef designs and manufactures components to move, store, and treat water.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
